      "text": "Here at Chicago’s International Mail Facility, CBP inspects roughly 12 million packages every year. These inspections keep America safe, and with the recent closing of the de minimis loophole on packages valued under $800, CBP is turbocharged to find the drugs and counterfeits that criminals try to send through our mail system.",
